Package: mirante
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mirante developers <noreply@localhost>
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libc6, yaru-theme-gtk, yaru-theme-icon, pkexec | policykit-1
Recommends: colord
Provides: image-viewer
Description: image viewer with cropping and colour correction
 Views BMP, PNG, JPEG, TIFF, PSD, HEIC and camera RAW images with ICC colour
 management, and crops and colour-corrects them non-destructively.
 Each format is a plugin that can be added or removed in Settings, for one
 user or for everyone. Installing it makes it the default image viewer.
